@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Inicio";
    Layout = "_LayoutPrivado";
}

<section class="hero">
    <svg class="hero-heart" viewBox="0 0 60 56" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M30 50C14 38 5 28 6 17 7 9 14 5 20 6c5 1 8 5 10 9 2-5 6-9 12-9 7 0 12 6 11 13-1 11-12 21-21 30"/><path d="M8 52c10 1 18-1 26-4"/></svg>
    <h1 class="hero-title"><span class="thin">Hola, @ViewBag.Nombre.</span><span class="bold">Empecemos a organizarnos.</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Bridge reúne a la familia y a quienes cuidan en un grupo de cuidado, con un chat compartido para que nadie se pierda nada.</p>
    <svg class="hero-wave" viewBox="0 0 1200 80" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M0 52 C 220 8, 420 10, 640 40 S 1020 78, 1200 22 V80 H0z" style="fill:var(--wave-1)"/>
        <path d="M0 70 C 260 40, 520 44, 760 62 S 1080 74, 1200 54 V80 H0z" style="fill:var(--wave-2)"/>
    </svg>
    <span class="script">Juntos somos puentes</span>
</section>

<section class="card">
    <div class="empty">
        <span class="icon-badge soft"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 11a4 4 0 1 0 0-8 4 4 0 0 0 0 8z M2 21a7 7 0 0 1 14 0 M16 3.5a4 4 0 0 1 0 7 M18 14a6 6 0 0 1 4 7"></path></svg></span>
        <p class="muted">Todavía no tenés grupos. Creá uno para la persona que cuidás, o pedile a quien administra su grupo que te invite.</p>
        <button type="button" class="btn sm secondary"><svg class="ic" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14 M5 12h14"></path></svg> Crear grupo de cuidado</button>
    </div>
</section>
